1
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,560
It has nothing to do with you.

2
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,090
Humans are social animals.

3
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,320
Only by finding a common target to hate

4
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,570
can they maintain their group.

5
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,810
When their IQ drops,

6
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,479
they act rudely

7
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,890
and think impulsively.

8
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:00,400
Only by stepping on an unlucky guy

9
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:02,450
can they prove they are doing well.

10
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,840
That's a good thing too.

11
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:11,330
I became the unlucky guy in their eyes,

12
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:16,460
so this harm won't happen to anyone else.

13
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,400
But this unyielding

14
00:02:35,079 --> 00:02:36,210
and fearless spirit

15
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,480
of yours,

16
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:41,650
I really admire.

17
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,520
I devoted all the joys and sorrows of youth

18
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:46,640
to one person.

19
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,640
Having such beautiful memories

20
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,480
reminds me in any situation

21
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,480
that I am a good person.

22
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,520
To me,

23
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,920
it's very important.

24
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,800
I thought I could be in so much pain

25
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,840
that I wouldn't feel anything anymore,

26
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,280
like having a superpower.

27
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:12,650
Thank you for bringing me back to reality,

28
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:15,140
becoming the answer to my questions,

29
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:17,120
engulfing me in love,

30
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,520
and then setting me free.

31
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:22,680
Go ahead.

32
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,860
I've got your back.

33
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:27,300
I am no longer afraid of the word "ordinary,"

34
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:29,160
nor am I afraid of being average.

35
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,320
I will find my own path.

36
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,040
Who are you?

37
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,680
I am your father.

38
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:44,610
Go after him!

39
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,800
Didn't you say looking at the sea is boring?

40
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:16,170
As long as I'm with my precious son,

41
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,800
nothing is boring.

42
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,920
If your mother were here,

43
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,920
it would be even better.

44
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:49,840
Mom

45
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,330
has always been protecting us.

46
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:24,560
So the books I drew inspiration from

47
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:27,360
were connected to form the plot of my dream.

48
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,960
Am I awake or dreaming right now?

49
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,760
My great writer Mala,

50
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:39,180
are you going to submit your manuscript?

51
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:41,600
What's your excuse for delaying this time?

52
00:05:42,159 --> 00:05:43,720
"Intrigue and Love"

53
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,159
You were abducted by aliens.

54
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:47,640
"The Brothers Karamazov"

55
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:49,680
The two-dimensionalization of the solar system swallowed your manuscript.

56
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,760
"The Count of Monte Cristo"

57
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:53,620
Supernatural forces taught you how to time travel.

58
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,440
When will you submit it?

59
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:57,370
You really can't delay any longer.

60
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,400
"Don Quixote"

61
00:05:59,400 --> 00:05:59,960
Waiting for you.

62
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:01,200
Don't delay anymore.

63
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,320
Son.

64
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:37,680
Son.

65
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:39,760
You're awake.

66
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,200
Good boy.

67
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,200
You're awake.

68
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,480
That's great.

69
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,180
I was so worried about you.

70
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,800
You worried me to death.

71
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:49,680
Okay.

72
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,400
It's good that you're awake.

73
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:52,600
Are you okay, son?

74
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:55,560
Doctor.

75
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:56,640
Doctor.

76
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:58,960
He's awake.

77
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:01,000
My son is awake.

78
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,920
Congratulations.

79
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,080
The surgery was very successful.

80
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,360
The patient is recovering well.

81
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,320
This is the first time we've seen a case like this.

82
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:13,080
It's a miracle in medical history.

83
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:15,210
Your ancestors must have blessed you.

84
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:17,080
Thank you.

85
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,000
The patient needs to rest now.

86
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:18,800
Let's talk over there.

87
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,960
Okay.

88
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:22,400
Son.

89
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,140
You rest first.

90
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,880
I'll go talk to the doctor.

91
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:26,760
You rest first.

92
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,760
Looking at pretty girls?

93
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,460
I just came to see if you were dead.

94
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,080
If not, I'll be leaving.

95
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:07,080
I've been wrong all along.

96
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:12,130
I want to spend the rest of my life with you.

97
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,280
What matters is you,

98
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,360
me,

99
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,400
and us.

100
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:19,760
Success or mediocrity,

101
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,080
poverty or wealth,

102
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:28,400
they are just the ways we experience this life.

103
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,919
I've been indulging in my own desires

104
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:44,460
without considering your feelings.

105
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:47,960
I'm sorry.

106
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,240
Su An.

107
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:02,060
Since when did you become so good with words?

108
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,200
I had a dream.

109
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,720
It was so real,

110
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:11,600
almost too real to be a dream.

111
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,140
I want to write it down.

112
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:24,920
Excuse me,

113
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:27,360
Mr. Mala.

114
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:30,690
The wedding necklace you ordered for Miss Su An has arrived.

115
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:31,970
Please check it.

116
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:45,340
You guys continue.

117
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,090
Go give the flowers.

118
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:54,280
Congratulations on wrapping up.

119
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:54,680
Thank you.

120
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,000
Congratulations on wrapping up.

121
