a group of children.

130
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:30,280
Secrets hidden for too long.

131
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,440
A shadow comes for revenge.

132
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,200
Li Zhiwei.

133
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:39,400
I told you before.

134
